<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore GIC buys 13.33 pct of Thai property firm.</title>
<headline>Singapore GIC buys 13.33 pct of Thai property firm.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>A unit of the Government of Singapore Investment Corp (GIC) has bought a minority stake in Thai property developer President Park Properties Public (PPP) Co Ltd, PPP said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that Reco Thai Park Pte Ltd bought 13.33 percent of PPP. It gave no financial details.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
